WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.354
Step 1. Open the organization.

1.2
00:00:02.354 --> 00:00:07.613
A government organization's Patients tab lists the patients that it covers.

1.3
00:00:07.613 --> 00:00:13.373
On your dashboard, select the Governance tab, then the organization's card.

2.1
00:00:13.373 --> 00:00:15.947
Step 3. Open the Patients tab.

2.2
00:00:15.947 --> 00:00:22.723
It shows only if you hold Can list patients in this organization or one above it.

3.1
00:00:22.723 --> 00:00:28.587
Step 4. Find a patient. In the search field, select Name or Phone Number.

3.2
00:00:28.587 --> 00:00:35.238
For Name, type any part of the name. For Phone Number, type the complete number.

4.1
00:00:35.238 --> 00:00:40.245
Step 5. Open a patient. On the patient's row, select Open.

4.2
00:00:40.245 --> 00:00:45.009
Care opens the patient's profile without a facility.
